ritten texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking to Borrow Something"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the modal <span class=\"strong\">can</span> to ask for permission when borrowing something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the phrase <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cCan I borrow \u2026 ?\u201d</span>  or <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cCould I borrow \u2026 ?\" </span> to ask someone for something for a short time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can answer with:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Sure. <br />No problem. <br />OK. <br />Yes, of course! </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span> : Can I borrow your class notes?<br /><span class=\"strong\"> Natalie</span> : No problem."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to borrow "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take something from someone and give it back later "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I borrow some money?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use in conversations about borrowing things."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "notes "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "information you write down  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I borrow your class notes?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mess  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an unorganised, dirty situation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Your notes are a mess!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stain "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a dirty mark on something that is difficult to remove "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are coffee stains on my notes!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to lend "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give something to someone for a short time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can lend you some money."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Just kidding "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "say this after you make a joke "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Your notes are bad! Just kidding!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "super "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very good "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That's a super idea!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'm dying to ... "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use this to talk about something you really want do  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm dying to get a new book now!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le03ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the role card. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose a role. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Create a short dialogue( 4 - 6 lines) about the situation. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Example:</span> <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Phil</span>: Hi. I want to buy a coffee. Can I borrow some money?<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Stan</span>: Um, I'm sorry but no. Just kidding. No problem.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Phil</span>: Thanks, Stan.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Stan</span>: You're welcome. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think of another situation and practice again."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You want to buy something, but you don't have money. Ask your friend to lend you some money. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Your friend wants to borrow some money. First, refuse. Then, agree.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ask to borrow something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk with a partner about borrowing money."}]}], "type": "sena"}